  "wayback_timestamp": "20160920100602",
  "content_html": "<div class=\"entry-content close\">\n    <h3>何謂 TogetherJS</h3>\n<p>本篇文章將介紹 <a href=\"https://web.archive.org/web/20160920100602/https://mozillalabs.com/\">Mozilla Labs</a> 所提供的即時協作 (Real-time collaboration) 工具 ─ <a href=\"https://web.archive.org/web/20160920100602/https://togetherjs.com/\">TogetherJS</a>。</p>\n<p>將 TogetherJS 添增至現有網站之後，即可加入即時合作功能。若有 2 名以上的使用者正在瀏覽網站或 Web App，則可看到彼此的滑鼠游標位置與點擊動作，另可互相追蹤瀏覽行為、一同編輯表單或觀看影片，並透過音訊或 <a href=\"https://web.archive.org/web/20160920100602/https://developer.mozilla.org/en-US/docs/WebRTC\">WebRTC</a> 的方式交談。</p>\n<p></p>\n<p>TogetherJS 的功能包含：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>觀看他人的滑鼠游標與點擊動作</li>\n<li>觀看捲動位置</li>\n<li>觀看他人瀏覽的網頁</li>\n<li>打字交談</li>\n<li>以 WebRTC 進行語音對話</li>\n<li>同步填寫表單 (寫入文字、勾選方塊等)</li>\n<li>同步播放/暫停/追蹤影片</li>\n<li>於單一網站上，可跨多個頁面保存工作階段 (Session)</li>\n</ul>\n<h3>整合方式</h3>\n<p>不需另外修改網站，即可發揮 TogetherJS 的多項功能。TogetherJS 將檢查文件物件模型 (Document Object Model，DOM) 而決定所應進行的作業 ─ 偵測表單欄位、偵測如 <a href=\"https://web.archive.org/web/20160920100602/http://codemirror.net/\">CodeMirror</a> 與 <a href=\"https://web.archive.org/web/20160920100602/http://ace.c9.io/\">Ace</a> 的編輯器，並將其工具列置入你的網頁中。</p>\n<p>如果你想玩玩看 TogetherJS，只要將下列指令碼加入你的網頁即可：</p><!-- Crayon Syntax Highlighter v_2.7.2_beta -->\n\n\t\t<div id=\"crayon-57e10a09867d2315197116\" class=\"crayon-syntax crayon-theme-arduino-ide crayon-font-monaco crayon-os-pc print-yes notranslate\" data-settings=\" minimize scroll-mouseover\" style=\" margin-top: 12px; margin-bottom: 12px; font-size: 12px !important; line-height: 15px !important;\">\n\t\t\n\t\t\t<div class=\"crayon-plain-wrap\"><textarea wrap=\"soft\" class=\"crayon-plain print-no\" data-settings=\"dblclick\" readonly style=\"-moz-tab-size:4; -o-tab-size:4; -webkit-tab-size:4; tab-size:4; font-size: 12px !important; line-height: 15px !important;\">\n&lt;script src=\"https://togetherjs.com/togetherjs.js\"&gt;&lt;/script&gt;</textarea></div>\n\t\t\t<div class=\"crayon-main\" style=\"\">\n\t\t\t\t<table class=\"crayon-table\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<tr class=\"crayon-row\">\n\t\t\t\t<td class=\"crayon-nums \" data-settings=\"show\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"crayon-nums-content\" style=\"font-size: 12px !important; line-height: 15px !important;\"><div class=\"crayon-num\" data-line=\"crayon-57e10a09867d2315197116-1\">1</div></div>\n\t\t\t\t</td>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<td class=\"crayon-code\"><div class=\"crayon-pre\" style=\"font-size: 12px !important; line-height: 15px !important; -moz-tab-size:4; -o-tab-size:4; -webkit-tab-size:4; tab-size:4;\"><div class=\"crayon-line\" id=\"crayon-57e10a09867d2315197116-1\"><span class=\"crayon-ta\">&lt;script </span><span class=\"crayon-e \">src</span><span class=\"crayon-o\">=</span><span class=\"crayon-s\">\"https://togetherjs.com/togetherjs.js\"</span><span class=\"crayon-o\">&gt;</span><span class=\"crayon-ta\">&lt;/script&gt;</span></div></div></td>\n\t\t\t\t\t</tr>\n\t\t\t\t</table>\n\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t</div>\n<!-- [Format Time: 0.0096 seconds] -->\n<p>接著為使用者建立 1 組按鈕，即可開啟 TogetherJS：</p><!-- Crayon Syntax Highlighter v_2.7.2_beta -->\n\n\t\t<div id=\"crayon-57e10a09867ef561330995\" class=\"crayon-syntax crayon-theme-arduino-ide crayon-font-monaco crayon-os-pc print-yes notranslate\" data-settings=\" minimize scroll-mouseover\" style=\" margin-top: 12px; margin-bottom: 12px; font-size: 12px !important; line-height: 15px !important;\">\n\t\t\n\t\t\t<div class=\"crayon-plain-wrap\"><textarea wrap=\"soft\" class=\"crayon-plain print-no\" data-settings=\"dblclick\" readonly style=\"-moz-tab-size:4; -o-tab-size:4; -webkit-tab-size:4; tab-size:4; font-size: 12px !important; line-height: 15px !important;\">\n&lt;button id=\"collaborate\" type=\"button\"&gt;Collaborate&lt;/button&gt;\n&lt;script&gt;\ndocument.getElementById(\"collaborate\")\n  .addEventListener(\"click\", TogetherJS, false);\n&lt;/script&gt;</textarea></div>\n\t\t\t<div class=\"crayon-main\" style=\"\">\n\t\t\t\t<table class=\"crayon-table\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<tr class=\"crayon-row\">\n\t\t\t\t<td class=\"crayon-nums \" data-settings=\"show\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"crayon-nums-content\" style=\"font-size: 12px !important; line-height: 15px !important;\"><div class=\"crayon-num\" data-line=\"crayon-57e10a09867ef561330995-1\">1</div><div class=\"crayon-num crayon-striped-num\" data-line=\"crayon-57e10a09867ef561330995-2\">2</div><div class=\"crayon-num\" data-line=\"crayon-57e10a09867ef561330995-3\">3</div><div class=\"crayon-num crayon-striped-num\" data-line=\"crayon-57e10a09867ef561330995-4\">4</div><div class=\"crayon-num\" data-line=\"crayon-57e10a09867ef561330995-5\">5</div></div>\n\t\t\t\t</td>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<td class=\"crayon-code\"><div class=\"crayon-pre\" style=\"font-size: 12px !important; line-height: 15px !important; -moz-tab-size:4; -o-tab-size:4; -webkit-tab-size:4; tab-size:4;\"><div class=\"crayon-line\" id=\"crayon-57e10a09867ef561330995-1\"><span class=\"crayon-o\">&lt;</span><span class=\"crayon-e\">button </span><span class=\"crayon-v\">id</span><span class=\"crayon-o\">=</span><span class=\"crayon-s\">\"collaborate\"</span><span class=\"crayon-h\"> </span><span class=\"crayon-v\">type</span><span class=\"crayon-o\">=</span><span class=\"crayon-s\">\"button\"</span><span class=\"crayon-o\">&gt;</span><span class=\"crayon-e\">Collaborate</span><span class=\"crayon-o\">&lt;</span><span class=\"crayon-o\">/</span><span class=\"crayon-e\">button</span><span class=\"crayon-o\">&gt;</span></div><div class=\"crayon-line crayon-striped-line\" id=\"crayon-57e10a09867ef561330995-2\"><span class=\"crayon-ta\">&lt;script&gt;</span></div><div class=\"crayon-line\" id=\"crayon-57e10a09867ef561330995-3\"><span class=\"crayon-v\">document</span><span class=\"crayon-sy\">.</span><span class=\"crayon-e\">getElementById</span><span class=\"crayon-sy\">(</span><span class=\"crayon-s\">\"collaborate\"</span><span class=\"crayon-sy\">)</span></div><div class=\"crayon-line crayon-striped-line\" id=\"crayon-57e10a09867ef561330995-4\"><span class=\"crayon-h\">&nbsp;&nbsp;</span><span class=\"crayon-sy\">.</span><span class=\"crayon-e\">addEventListener</span><span class=\"crayon-sy\">(</span><span class=\"crayon-s\">\"click\"</span><span class=\"crayon-sy\">,</span><span class=\"crayon-h\"> </span><span class=\"crayon-v\">TogetherJS</span><span class=\"crayon-sy\">,</span><span class=\"crayon-h\"> </span><span class=\"crayon-t\">false</span><span class=\"crayon-sy\">)</span><span class=\"crayon-sy\">;</span></div><div class=\"crayon-line\" id=\"crayon-57e10a09867ef561330995-5\"><span class=\"crayon-ta\">&lt;/script&gt;</span></div></div></td>\n\t\t\t\t\t</tr>\n\t\t\t\t</table>\n\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t</div>\n<!-- [Format Time: 0.0041 seconds] -->\n<p>如果你想直接體驗 TogetherJS 的功能，則 <a href=\"https://web.archive.org/web/20160920100602/http://jsfiddle.net/\">jsFiddle</a> 也已納入 TogetherJS 供你參考：</p>\n<p><img class=\"aligncenter size-full wp-image-4028\" alt=\"screenshot-jsfiddle-highlight\" src=\"https://web.archive.org/web/20160920100602im_/http://blog.mozilla.com.tw/wp-content/uploads/screenshot-jsfiddle-highlight.png\" width=\"729\" height=\"87\" srcset=\"https://web.archive.org/web/20160920100602im_/http://blog.mozilla.com.tw/wp-content/uploads/screenshot-jsfiddle-highlight.png 729w, https://web.archive.org/web/20160920100602im_/http://blog.mozilla.com.tw/wp-content/uploads/screenshot-jsfiddle-highlight-300x35.png 300w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 729px) 100vw, 729px\"/></p>\n<p>只要點選「<strong>Collaboration</strong>」就會啟動 TogetherJS。接著將說明應如何在自己的 Fiddle 中使用 TogetherJS。</p>\n<h3>擴充自己的 App</h3>\n<p>TogetherJS 在檢查過 DOM 之後，即可決定所該進行的作業，但無法同步你的 JavaScript App。舉例來說，如果你的 App 有 1 份項目清單必須透過 JavaScript 更新，則該清單不會在使用者之間自動同步。大家有時會以為清單能自動更新，但就算我們跨 2 個網頁同步了 DOM，也還是無法同步底層的 JavaScript 物件。相較於 <a href=\"https://web.archive.org/web/20160920100602/http://www.firebase.com/\">Firebase</a> 或 <a href=\"https://web.archive.org/web/20160920100602/https://developers.google.com/drive/realtime/\">Google Drive Realtime API</a> 等產品，TogetherJS 並不具備即時的永久儲存功能。你的儲存與網站功能都由你自己決定，我們只會同步瀏覽器本身的工作狀態。</p>\n<p>因為如此，如果你的 App 必須執行很多 JavaScript，就必須再加進額外程式碼以保持工作狀態的同步。而我們現正努力簡化此過程！</p>\n<p>我們以簡單的繪圖 App 為例，並將之發佈<a href=\"https://web.archive.org/web/20160920100602/http://jsfiddle.net/ianbicking/5M57n/8/\">作為 Fiddle 的完整範例</a>隨你盡情把玩。</p>\n<p><img class=\"aligncenter size-large wp-image-4030\" alt=\"screenshot-fiddle-example\" src=\"https://web.archive.org/web/20160920100602im_/http://blog.mozilla.com.tw/wp-content/uploads/screenshot-fiddle-example-1024x616.png\" width=\"640\" height=\"385\" srcset=\"https://web.archive.org/web/20160920100602im_/http://blog.mozilla.com.tw/wp-content/uploads/screenshot-fiddle-example-1024x616.png 1024w, https://web.archive.org/web/20160920100602im_/http://blog.mozilla.com.tw/wp-content/uploads/screenshot-fiddle-example-300x180.png 300w, https://web.archive.org/web/20160920100602im_/http://blog.mozilla.com.tw/wp-content/uploads/screenshot-fiddle-example.png 1213w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 640px) 100vw, 640px\"/></p>\n<h3>簡易的繪圖 App</h3>\n<p>我們先從簡單的繪圖 App 開始吧。先來個簡單的繪圖區 (canvas)：</p><!-- Crayon Syntax Highlighter v_2.7.2_beta -->\n\n\t\t<div id=\"crayon-57e10a09867ff679331856\" class=\"crayon-syntax crayon-theme-arduino-ide crayon-font-monaco crayon-os-pc print-yes notranslate\" data-settings=\" minimize scroll-mouseover\" style=\" margin-top: 12px; margin-bottom: 12px; font-size: 12px !important; line-height: 15px !important;\">\n\t\t\n\t\t\t<div class=\"crayon-plain-wrap\"><textarea wrap=\"soft\" class=\"crayon-plain print-no\" data-settings=\"dblclick\" readonly style=\"-moz-tab-size:4; -o-tab-size:4; -webkit-tab-size:4; tab-size:4; font-size: 12px !important; line-height: 15px !important;\">\n&lt;canvas id=\"sketch\" \n        style=\"height: 400px; width: 400px; border: 1px solid #000\"&gt;\n&lt;/canvas&gt;</textarea></div>\n\t\t\t<div class=\"crayon-main\" style=\"\">\n\t\t\t\t<table class=\"crayon-table\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<tr class=\"crayon-row\">\n\t\t\t\t<td class=\"crayon-nums \" data-settings=\"show\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"crayon-nums-content\" style=\"font-size: 12px !important; line-height: 15px !important;\"><div class=\"crayon-num\" data-line=\"crayon-57e10a09867ff679331856-1\">1</div><div class=\"crayon-num crayon-striped-num\" data-line=\"crayon-57e10a09867ff679331856-2\">2</div><div class=\"crayon-num\" data-line=\"crayon-57e10a09867ff679331856-3\">3</div></div>\n\t\t\t\t</td>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<td class=\"crayon-code\"><div class=\"crayon-pre\" style=\"font-size: 12px !important; line-height: 15px !important; -moz-tab-size:4; -o-tab-size:4; -webkit-tab-size:4; tab-size:4;\"><div class=\"crayon-line\" id=\"crayon-57e10a09867ff679331856-1\"><span class=\"crayon-o\">&lt;</span><span class=\"crayon-e\">canvas </span><span class=\"crayon-v\">id</span><span class=\"crayon-o\">=</span><span class=\"crayon-s\">\"sketch\"</span><span class=\"crayon-h\"> </span></div><div class=\"crayon-line crayon-striped-line\" id=\"crayon-57e10a09867ff679331856-2\"><span class=\"crayon-h\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;</span><span class=\"crayon-v\">style</span><span class=\"crayon-o\">=</span><span class=\"crayon-s\">\"height: 400px; width: 400px; border: 1px solid #000\"</span><span class=\"crayon-o\">&gt;</span></div><div class=\"crayon-line\" id=\"crayon-57e10a09867ff679331856-3\"><span class=\"crayon-o\">&lt;</span><span class=\"crayon-o\">/</span><span class=\"crayon-v\">canvas</span><span class=\"crayon-o\">&gt;</span></div></div></td>\n\t\t\t\t\t</tr>\n\t\t\t\t</table>\n\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t</div>\n<!-- [Format Time: 0.0022 seconds] -->\n<p>接著完成某些設定：</p><!-- Crayon Syntax Highlighter v_2.7.2_beta -->\n\n\t\t<div id=\"crayon-57e10a098680b018424162\" class=\"crayon-syntax crayon-theme-arduino-ide crayon-font-monaco crayon-os-pc print-yes notranslate\" data-settings=\" minimize scroll-mouseover\" style=\" margin-top: 12px; margin-bottom: 12px; font-size: 12px !important; line-height: 15px !important;\">\n\t\t\n\t\t\t<div class=\"crayon-plain-wrap\"><textarea wrap=\"soft\" class=\"crayon-plain print-no\" data-settings=\"dblclick\" readonly style=\"-moz-tab-size:4; -o-tab-size:4; -webkit-tab-size:4; tab-size:4; font-size: 12px !important; line-height: 15px !important;\">\n// get the canvas element and its context\nvar canvas = document.querySelector('#sketch');\nvar context = canvas.getContext('2d');\n\n// brush settings\ncontext.lineWidth = 2;\ncontext.lineJoin = 'round';\ncontext.lineCap = 'round';\ncontext.strokeStyle = '#000';</textarea></div>\n\t\t\t<div class=\"crayon-main\" style=\"\">\n\t\t\t\t<table class=\"crayon-table\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<tr class=\"crayon-row\">\n\t\t\t\t<td class=\"crayon-nums \" data-settings=\"show\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"crayon-nums-content\" style=\"font-size: 12px !important; line-height: 15px !important;\"><div class=\"crayon-num\" data-line=\"crayon-57e10a098680b018424162-1\">1</div><div class=\"crayon-num crayon-striped-num\" data-line=\"crayon-57e10a098680b018424162-2\">2</div><div class=\"crayon-num\" data-line=\"crayon-57e10a098680b018424162-3\">3</div><div class=\"crayon-num crayon-striped-num\" data-line=\"crayon-57e10a098680b018424162-4\">4</div><div class=\"crayon-num\" data-line=\"crayon-57e10a098680b018424162-5\">5</div><div class=\"crayon-num crayon-striped-num\" data-line=\"crayon-57e10a098680b018424162-6\">6</div><div class=\"crayon-num\" data-line=\"crayon-57e10a098680b018424162-7\">7</div><div class=\"crayon-num crayon-striped-num\" data-line=\"crayon-57e10a098680b018424162-8\">8</div><div class=\"crayon-num\" data-line=\"crayon-57e10a098680b018424162-9\">9</div></div>\n\t\t\t\t</td>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<td class=\"crayon-code\"><div class=\"crayon-pre\" style=\"font-size: 12px !important; line-height: 15px !important; -moz-tab-size:4; -o-tab-size:4; -webkit-tab-size:4; tab-size:4;\"><div class=\"crayon-line\" id=\"crayon-57e10a098680b018424162-1\"><span class=\"crayon-c\">// get the canvas element and its context</span></div><div class=\"crayon-line crayon-striped-line\" id=\"crayon-57e10a098680b018424162-2\"><span class=\"crayon-t\">var</span><span class=\"crayon-h\"> </span><span class=\"crayon-v\">canvas</span><span class=\"crayon-h\"> </span><span class=\"crayon-o\">=</span><span class=\"crayon-h\"> </span><span class=\"crayon-v\">document</span><span class=\"crayon-sy\">.</span><span class=\"crayon-e\">querySelector</span><span class=\"crayon-sy\">(</span><span class=\"crayon-s\">'#sketch'</span><span class=\"crayon-sy\">)</span><span class=\"crayon-sy\">;</span></div><div class=\"crayon-line\" id=\"crayon-57e10a098680b018424162-3\"><span class=\"crayon-t\">var</span><span class=\"crayon-h\"> </span><span class=\"crayon-v\">context</span><span class=\"crayon-h\"> </span><span class=\"crayon-o\">=</span><span class=\"crayon-h\"> </span><span class=\"crayon-v\">canvas</span><span class=\"crayon-sy\">.</span><span class=\"crayon-e\">getContext</span><span class=\"crayon-sy\">(</span><span class=\"crayon-s\">'2d'</span><span class=\"crayon-sy\">)</span><span class=\"crayon-sy\">;</span></div><div class=\"crayon-line crayon-striped-line\" id=\"crayon-57e10a098680b018424162-4\">&nbsp;</div><div class=\"crayon-line\" id=\"crayon-57e10a098680b018424162-5\"><span class=\"crayon-c\">// brush settings</span></div><div class=\"crayon-line crayon-striped-line\" id=\"crayon-57e10a098680b018424162-6\"><span class=\"crayon-v\">context</span><span class=\"crayon-sy\">.</span><span class=\"crayon-v\">lineWidth</span><span class=\"crayon-h\"> </span><span class=\"crayon-o\">=</span><span class=\"crayon-h\"> </span><span class=\"crayon-cn\">2</span><span class=\"crayon-sy\">;</span></div><div class=\"crayon-line\" id=\"crayon-57e10a098680b018424162-7\"><span class=\"crayon-v\">context</span><span class=\"crayon-sy\">.</span><span class=\"crayon-v\">lineJoin</span><span class=\"crayon-h\"> </span><span class=\"crayon-o\">=</span><span class=\"crayon-h\"> </span><span class=\"crayon-s\">'round'</span><span class=\"crayon-sy\">;</span></div><div class=\"crayon-line crayon-striped-line\" id=\"crayon-57e10a098680b018424162-8\"><span class=\"crayon-v\">context</span><span class=\"crayon-sy\">.</span><span class=\"crayon-v\">lineCap</span><span class=\"crayon-h\"> </span><span class=\"crayon-o\">=</span><span class=\"crayon-h\"> </span><span class=\"crayon-s\">'round'</span><span class=\"crayon-sy\">;</span></div><div class=\"crayon-line\" id=\"crayon-57e10a098680b018424162-9\"><span class=\"crayon-v\">context</span><span class=\"crayon-sy\">.</span><span class=\"crayon-v\">strokeStyle</span><span class=\"crayon-h\"> </span><span class=\"crayon-o\">=</span><span class=\"crayon-h\"> </span><span class=\"crayon-s\">'#000'</span><span class=\"crayon-sy\">;</span></div></div></td>\n\t\t\t\t\t</tr>\n\t\t\t\t</table>\n\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t</div>\n<!-- [Format Time: 0.0056 seconds] -->\n<p>我們在繪圖區上使用 <code>mousedown</code> 與 <code>mouseup</code> 事件，針對 <code>mousemove 事件註冊我們的</code> <code>move()</code> 處理器：</p><!-- Crayon Syntax Highlighter v_2.7.2_beta -->\n\n\t\t<div id=\"crayon-57e10a0986816041286693\" class=\"crayon-syntax crayon-theme-arduino-ide crayon-font-monaco crayon-os-pc print-yes notranslate\" data-settings=\" minimize scroll-mouseover\" style=\" margin-top: 12px; margin-bottom: 12px; font-size: 12px !important; line-height: 15px !important;\">\n\t\t\n\t\t\t<div class=\"crayon-plain-wrap\"><textarea wrap=\"soft\" class=\"crayon-plain print-no\" data-settings=\"dblclick\" readonly style=\"-moz-tab-size:4; -o-tab-size:4; -webkit-tab-size:4; tab-size:4; font-size: 12px !important; line-height: 15px !important;\">\nvar lastMouse = {\n  x: 0,\n  y: 0\n};\n\n// attach the mousedown, mousemove, mouseup event listeners.\ncanvas.addEventListener('mousedown', function (e) {\n    lastMouse = {\n        x: e.pageX - this.offsetLeft,\n        y: e.pageY - this.offsetTop\n    };\n    canvas.addEventListener('mousemove', move, false);\n}, false);\n\ncanvas.addEventListener('mouseup', function () {\n    canvas.removeEventListener('mousemove', move, false);\n}, false);</textarea></div>\n\t\t\t<div class=\"crayon-main\" style=\"\">\n\t\t\t\t<table class=\"crayon-table\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<tr class=\"crayon-row\">\n\t\t\t\t<td class=\"crayon-nums \" data-settings=\"show\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"crayon-nums-content\" style=\"font-size: 12px !important; line-height: 15px !important;\"><div class=\"crayon-num\" data-line=\"crayon-57e10a0986816041286693-1\">1</div><div class=\"crayon-num crayon-striped-num\" data-line=\"crayon-57e10a0986816041286693-2\">2</div><div class=\"crayon-num\" data-line=\"crayon-57e10a0986816041286693-3\">3</div><div class=\"crayon-num crayon-striped-num\" data-line=\"crayon-57e10a0986816041286693-4\">4</div><div class=\"crayon-num\" data-line=\"crayon-57e10a0986816041286693-5\">5</div><div class=\"crayon-num crayon-striped-num\" data-line=\"crayon-57e10a0986816041286693-6\">6</div><div class=\"crayon-num\" data-line=\"crayon-57e10a0986816041286693-7\">7</div><div class=\"crayon-num crayon-striped-num\" data-line=\"crayon-57e10a0986816041286693-8\">8</div><div class=\"crayon-num\" data-line=\"crayon-57e10a0986816041286693-9\">9</div><div class=\"crayon-num crayon-striped-num\" data-line=\"crayon-57e10a0986816041286693-10\">10</div><div class=\"crayon-num\" data-line=\"crayon-57e10a0986816041286693-11\">11</div><div class=\"crayon-num crayon-striped-num\" data-line=\"crayon-57e10a0986816041286693-12\">12</div><div class=\"crayon-num\" data-line=\"crayon-57e10a0986816041286693-13\">13</div><div class=\"crayon-num crayon-striped-num\" data-line=\"crayon-57e10a0986816041286693-14\">14</div><div class=\"crayon-num\" data-line=\"crayon-57e10a0986816041286693-15\">15</div><div class=\"crayon-num crayon-striped-num\" data-line=\"crayon-57e10a0986816041286693-16\">16</div><div class=\"crayon-num\" data-line=\"crayon-57e10a0986816041286693-17\">17</div></div>\n\t\t\t\t</td>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<td class=\"crayon-code\"><div class=\"crayon-pre\" style=\"font-size: 12px !important; line-height: 15px !important; -moz-tab-size:4; -o-tab-size:4; -webkit-tab-size:4